# Secret Hygiene

Allowed: `${VAR}`, `vault://path`, `op://vault/item`, `<REDACTED>`.
Forbidden: real keys, JWTs, private keys, `.env` values, dummy-realistic secrets.
After edits under security paths: `python3 scripts/secret_scan.py`.
Hooks may redact on beforeReadFile. Never commit credentials.
Never paste live secrets into chat, CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, rules, or screenshots (context/transcript leak). `.cursorignore` keeps key files out of indexing.
